WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:04.155
By the end of this module you should be able to
explain when distributed processing

00:00:04.168 --> 00:00:09.734
is useful describe the basic Spark execution model
and understand how Spark SQL and DataFrames

00:00:09.747 --> 00:00:15.642
connect You should also be able to reason about
lakehouse tables schema choices

00:00:15.813 --> 00:00:22.287
Delta tables query plans partitions and shuffles at
an introductory level The

00:00:22.314 --> 00:00:25.945
goal is practical understanding not cluster
administration
